B.YH=new A.aQ(B.H,B.ao,31,"Numbers 1 and 0","Reach up with your little fingers to 1 (left) and 0 (right).","10 112 111 711 11 000 101 10 0k 01 111 00 10 00k 010 11j 11l 010 07 d00 0k 711 00 l11 030 000 00 008 11 20 70 00 070 11 01 11 311 0d 01 818 00s 20 01 11",90,0,"Stage 5 \xb7 Number Row","10","Left little: 1 \xb7 Right little: 0","1 is above Q and 0 is above P. These are the farthest keys \u2014 go slowly.")
B.YX=new A.aQ(B.H,B.ao,32,"Numbers 5 and 6","Stretch your index fingers to 5 (left) and 6 (right).","565 66 666 555 63 662 54 585 555 55 555 646 6f6 f6 6f6 555 65 55 5d 555 6s 676 64 54 55 56 f6f 55 j6 656 555 55 65 j55 55 666 66 f6f 65 55 57 57 l6 55f",90,0,"Stage 5 \xb7 Number Row","56","Left index: 5 \xb7 Right index: 6","5 is above T and 6 is above Y.")
B.Zo=new A.aQ(B.H,B.ao,33,"Numbers Review","All ten digits together.","1234567890 0987654321 1357924680 2468013579 1029384756 5647382910 1111 2222 3333 4444 5555 6666 7777 8888 9999 0000 12 34 56 78 90",90,0,"Stage 5 \xb7 Number Row","","All eight fingers","Say each number out loud in your head as you type it.")
B.Yj=new A.aQ(B.H,B.ao,34,"Numbers in Sentences","Letters, numbers and punctuation together.","Room 204, Floor 3. I have 3 cats and 12 chicks. The year is 2026. Dial 042 1234567. Page 45, line 18. Bus 7 leaves at 9:30. We sold 150 books on day 1.",90,0,"Stage 5 \xb7 Number Row","","All eight fingers",u.X)
B.YJ=new A.aQ(B.H,B.ao,35,"Email and Web Symbols","Type @ _ and web addresses.","ali@mail.com sara_khan@mail.com www.example.com https://example.com/home user_name_2026 zara-ahmed@mail.com shop.example.com/book_list",90,0,"Stage 6 \xb7 Symbols","@_","@ is Shift + 2 (left ring) \xb7 _ is Shift + - (right little)","Use the opposite-side Shift. @ uses the RIGHT Shift. Underscore uses the LEFT Shift.")
B.Zy=new A.aQ(B.H,B.ao,36,"Money and Math Symbols","Type $ % + = * and /.","Price: $25 + $15 = $40. 50% of 200 is 100. 8 * 7 = 56. 9 / 3 = 3. Total: $120 - $20 = $100. Save 10% today.",90,0,"Stage 6 \xb7 Symbols","$%+=*","$ % + = * all use Shift (+ number key) \u2014 use the opposite-side Shift","$ is Shift + 4, % is Shift + 5, * is Shift + 8, + is Shift + =. Equal sign is next to the hyphen.")
B.YF=new A.aQ(B.H,B.ao,37,"Brackets and Other Symbols","Type ( ) [ ] { } < > & #.","(one) [two] {three} <four> a & b #tag (a + b) * [c - d] = {e} if (x > 5) { y = 1; } Q&A #1 <b>bold</b>",90,0,"Stage 6 \xb7 Symbols","()[]{}<>&#","Shift + 9 and 0 for ( ) \xb7 [ ] { } are next to P \xb7 < > are Shift + , and .","Brackets sit near your right little finger. Take it slowly and use the opposite-side Shift.")
B.YB=new A.aQ(B.H,B.ao,38,"Common English Words","The words you will type most often.","the and for you are with his they have this from that not but what all were when your can said there use each which she how their will other about out many then them these some her would make like him into time has look two more write see number way could people my than first water been call who oil its now find long down day did get come made may part",90,0,"Stage 7 \xb7 Words & Sentences","","All ten fingers",u.R)
B.YM=new A.aQ(B.H,B.ao,39,"Short Sentences","Short, natural sentences.","The sun is bright today. We went to the market. She reads a book every night. Please close the door. My brother plays cricket. The tea is hot. Tomorrow we will visit the park.",90,0,"Stage 7 \xb7 Words & Sentences","","All ten fingers","Press Space with your thumb. Try to keep an even rhythm.")
B.YQ=new A.aQ(B.H,B.ao,40,"Longer Sentences","Longer sentences with commas and periods.","When the rain stopped, we walked to the old bridge, and the whole city looked fresh and quiet. Although it was late, Ali finished his work, checked it twice, and then went home.",90,0,"Stage 7 \xb7 Words & Sentences","","All ten fingers","Commas and periods are part of the rhythm \u2014 do not skip them.")
B.Yr=new A.aQ(B.H,B.ao,41,"Paragraph Practice",u.m,"Learning to type well takes patience. At first, your fingers feel slow and clumsy, but every day they remember a little more. After a few weeks, you will type without looking at the keys, and your speed will grow naturally.",90,0,"Stage 7 \xb7 Words & Sentences","","All ten fingers","Accuracy first. Speed comes by itself.")
B.cW=new A.lZ(2,"advanced")
B.Yp=new A.aQ(B.H,B.cW,42,"Accuracy Challenge","Type slowly and aim for 95% accuracy.",'Quietly, the quick zebra jumped over six wooden boxes. Seven brave judges examined fifty-two huge frozen jars. "Why, exactly?" asked Ms. Vaz. Perfect practice makes progress.',95,0,"Stage 8 \xb7 Speed & Accuracy","","All ten fingers",u.s)
B.Zw=new A.aQ(B.H,B.cW,43,"Speed Builder 1","Reach 15 WPM with at least 90% accuracy.","We like to walk by the river in the morning. The air is cool and the birds sing in the trees. After a short rest, we drink tea and talk about our day.",90,15,"Stage 8 \xb7 Speed & Accuracy","","All ten fingers","Target: 15 WPM. Keep your eyes on the screen.")
B.Zt=new A.aQ(B.H,B.cW,44,"Speed Builder 2","Reach 20 WPM with at least 90% accuracy.","A good habit is built one day at a time. If you practise a little every day, your hands learn the path between the keys, and typing begins to feel as natural as walking.",90,20,"Stage 8 \xb7 Speed & Accuracy","","All ten fingers","Target: 20 WPM. Do not rush the hard words.")
B.Zp=new A.aQ(B.H,B.cW,45,"Speed Builder 3","Reach 25 WPM with at least 90% accuracy.","The best way to improve is to relax your shoulders, breathe, and let your fingers do the work. Fast typists are not tense; they are smooth. Smooth leads to fast, and fast follows when you stay calm.",90,25,"Stage 8 \xb7 Speed & Accuracy","","All ten fingers","Target: 25 WPM. Smooth beats tense.")
B.YN=new A.aQ(B.H,B.cW,46,"Final Test","Show what you have learned: 25 WPM and 95% accuracy.","Touch typing is a skill that stays with you for life. Today you have learned every key, every finger, and how to keep a steady rhythm. Keep practising, keep your accuracy high, and your speed will continue to grow week after week.",95,25,"Stage 8 \xb7 Speed & Accuracy","","All ten fingers",u.W)
